{"suttaId":"thi-ap36","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10385,10458],"vripara":"143"},"segments":{"thi-ap36:0.3":"Abhirūpanandātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap36:1.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī nāma nāyako;","thi-ap36:1.3":"Uppajji cārudassano, sabbadhammesu cakkhumā.","thi-ap36:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ bandhumatiyaṃ, iddhe phīte mahākule;","thi-ap36:2.3":"Jātā surūpā dayitā, pūjanīyā janassa ca.","thi-ap36:3.1":"“Upagantvā mahāvīraṃ, vipassiṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap36:3.3":"Dhammaṃ suṇitvā saraṇaṃ, upesiṃ naranāyakaṃ.","thi-ap36:4.1":"“Sīlesu saṃvutā hutvā, nibbute ca naruttame;","thi-ap36:4.3":"Dhātuthūpassa upari, soṇṇacchattamapūjayiṃ.","thi-ap36:5.1":"“Muttacāgā sīlavatī, yāvajīvaṃ tato cutā;","thi-ap36:5.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsūpagā ahaṃ.","thi-ap36:6.1":"“Tadā dasahi ṭhānehi, adhibhotvāna sesake [adhibhotvā asesato (syā.)];","thi-ap36:6.3":"Rūpasaddehi gandhehi, rasehi phusanehi ca.","thi-ap36:7.1":"“Āyunāpi ca vaṇṇena, sukhena yasasāpi ca;","thi-ap36:7.3":"Tathevādhipateyyena, adhigayha virocahaṃ.","thi-ap36:8.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jātāhaṃ kapilavhaye;","thi-ap36:8.3":"Dhītā khemakasakkassa, nandā nāmāti vissutā.","thi-ap36:9.1":"“Abhirūpasampadampi [abhirupaṃ upapadaṃ (sī.), abhirupaṃ uppādaṃ (pī.)], ahu me kantisūcakaṃ;","thi-ap36:9.3":"Yadāhaṃ yobbanappattā, rūpalāvaññabhūsitā.","thi-ap36:10.1":"“Tadā [tadā mamatthaṃ (sī.), idha mamatte (syā. ka.)] matthe sakyānaṃ, vivādo sumahā ahu;","thi-ap36:10.3":"Pabbājesi tato tāto, mā sakyā vinassiṃsuti.","thi-ap36:11.1":"“Pabbajitvā tathāgataṃ, rūpadessiṃ naruttamaṃ;","thi-ap36:11.3":"Sutvāna nopagacchāmi, mama rūpena gabbitā.","thi-ap36:12.1":"“Ovādampi na gacchāmi, buddhadassanabhīrutā;","thi-ap36:12.3":"Tadā jino upāyena, upanetvā sasantikaṃ.","thi-ap36:13.1":"“Tissitthiyo [tisso thīyo (sī. pī.)] nidassesi, iddhiyā maggakovido;","thi-ap36:13.3":"Accharārūpasadisaṃ, taruṇiṃ jaritaṃ [jarikaṃ (syā. ka.)] mataṃ.","thi-ap36:14.1":"“Tāyo disvā susaṃviggā, virattāse kaḷevare;","thi-ap36:14.3":"Aṭṭhāsiṃ bhavanibbindā, tadā maṃ āha nāyako.","thi-ap36:15.1":"“‘Āturaṃ asuciṃ pūtiṃ, passa nande samussayaṃ;","thi-ap36:15.3":"Uggharantaṃ paggharantaṃ, bālānaṃ abhinanditaṃ.","thi-ap36:16.1":"“‘Asubhāya cittaṃ bhāvehi, ekaggaṃ susamāhitaṃ;","thi-ap36:16.3":"Yathā idaṃ tathā etaṃ, yathā etaṃ tathā idaṃ.","thi-ap36:17.1":"“‘Evametaṃ avekkhantī, rattindivamatanditā;","thi-ap36:17.3":"Tato sakāya paññāya, abhinibbijjha vacchasi’.","thi-ap36:18.1":"“Tassā me appamattāya, vicarantiyā [vicarantvādha (sī.), vicinantīdha (syā. pī.)] yoniso;","thi-ap36:18.3":"Yathābhūtaṃ ayaṃ kāyo, diṭṭho santarabāhiro.","thi-ap36:19.1":"“Atha nibbindahaṃ kāye, ajjhattañca virajjahaṃ;","thi-ap36:19.3":"Appamattā visaṃyuttā, upasantāmhi nibbutā.","thi-ap36:20.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap36:20.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap36:21.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap36:21.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap36:22.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap36:22.3":"Ñāṇaṃ mama mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap36:23.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap36:24.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap36:25.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap36:26.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ abhirūpanandā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap36:27.1":"Abhirūpanandātheriyāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
